        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 46,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Live Updates with Our Capgo Service"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 48,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 48,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "We're proud to offer Capgo, our solution that enables live updates for your Capacitor apps, allowing you to deliver Over-The-Air (OTA) updates at a fair price. This feature is particularly useful for making quick fixes, deploying new features, and ensuring your users always have the latest version of your app without waiting for app store approval."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 50,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 3,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 50,
            "column": 5
          },
          "text": "How Our Capgo Service Works"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 52,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 52,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Capgo is a cloud-based service that allows you to deploy live updates to your Capacitor apps. It consists of a web dashboard and a native SDK that you can integrate into your app. The SDK checks for updates on startup or at specific intervals and downloads them in the background. When an update is available, the SDK will prompt the user to install it. If the user accepts, the update will be installed and applied immediately."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
